{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/","folio-assistant-core":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant-core/v0/ns/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/rem-shadow-ordering-compute-shortcut","@type":["folio-assistant-core:Remark","doco:Section"],"label":"rem:shadow-ordering-compute-shortcut","kind":"remark","title":"Computational shortcut from local constancy","uses":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/def-local-shadow-ordering","papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/def-unstable-atom","papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/prop-phase-boundary-variety","papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/prop-confinement-local-constancy"],"interprets":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/def-local-shadow-ordering","tags":["computational-shortcut","local-constancy","phase-boundary","interpolation"],"text":"shadow-ordering-compute-shortcut.md","provenance":"authored","html":"<a id=\"rem:shadow-ordering-compute-shortcut\"></a><p>Following the <a href=\"#def:unstable-atom\" data-at=\"knots-particles-confinement/atom-isotope-knots\">unstable-atom</a> \"Computational shortcut\", restrict expensive computations (per-generator <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\hat V_i^{\\mathrm{full}}</code> extraction) to exact evaluation only at points of the <a href=\"#prop:phase-boundary-variety\" data-at=\"climax-volume-mass/knot-operator-energy\">phase-boundary variety</a> <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathcal{B}</code>. In the complement <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">Q \\setminus \\mathcal{B}</code>, all shadow prices, the filtration, and the per-generator data are locally constant (by <a href=\"#prop:confinement-local-constancy\" data-at=\"climax-volume-mass/knot-operator-energy\">local constancy of confinement</a>). Linear interpolation between nearest magic-number anchors is mathematically justified.</p>\n","source":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/climax-volume-mass/shadow-ordering-compute-shortcut.md","heading":"Remark","number":"12.4.10","page":"b/rem-shadow-ordering-compute-shortcut","qa":{"counts":{"pass":59,"fail":0,"warn":1,"na":17,"unknown":0,"stale":60},"milnor":{"total":2,"notPassing":0}}}
